#: T:frontend/templates/frontend/documentation/topics/getting_started.html
msgid "Quadrum is a Django-based <strong>Simple Management System</strong> for product inventory, point-of-sale (POS) sales, accounts receivable, and basic reporting. This page covers the basics of signing in, finding your way around, and the everyday workflows."
